# Milestone 2024, Llama 3 (Meta, 2024), dense: Llama 2's decoder (m2023_llama2.bux)
# with RoPE at base 500k. Its grouped-query attention shares a key and value head among
# 4 query heads, as Llama 3 8B's 8 among 32 do.
use m2023_llama2

l3_attn = l2_attn(rope=rope(base=500000))

llama3 = embed ([l2_norm l3_attn] [l2_norm l2_ffn])^layers l2_norm head
model  = llama3
